## App Configuration

One app instance's settings, carried once on its app card: the Record Identifier pattern and mint counter, a default SLA Window, the Integration References it talks to, its Automation Policies, and where a setup wizard left off (`setupStep`, `setupCompletedAt`). App-agnostic: a support app and a billing app keep their settings in the same shape.

```ts
import { AppConfigurationField } from '@cardstack/catalog/fields/app-configuration/app-configuration-field';

@field config = contains(AppConfigurationField);
```

### Non-goals

Not realm config and not per-user preferences — one per app instance.
